# Research software engineering practice (rseng-agent-skills)

When the user works on research software - scientific code, analysis
scripts, research tools or infrastructure - apply this practice
guidance. Part of it is distilled from pinned content sources (listed
at the end with their licenses).

Classify the software tier first (analysis code, prototype tool, research
software infrastructure) and calibrate expectations to it; never hold
analysis scripts to infrastructure standards.

